5,0,1,talk,Mio,,"Hi everyone! I'm so excited to play! Let's all be super honest and open so we can find the werewolf quickly, okay? Who wants to start?","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Misaki,,"Hello. I think being too open might be risky. The werewolf and possessed can lie, but we cannot. We should be cautious.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,Hello. I agree with Misaki. A calm approach is often more revealing than a rushed one.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Kenji,,"Hey! I'm Kenji! I just want us all to get along. But we have to find the bad guy, right? I'll help everyone!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,Good evening. A pleasure to meet you all. I believe a balance of observation and logic will serve us best. Let us see who reveals themselves first.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Mio,,"Aww, Misaki is being so serious! Maybe the ""cautious"" ones are just trying to hide something? Let's just talk a lot!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Misaki,,"That is a leap in logic, Mio. Silence is not evidence of guilt; it is a strategy for survival.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,pass,Jonathan,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""norm"":[{""code"":""pass_punct"",""token"":""Skip"",""raw"":""Skip.""}],""raw"":""Skip.""}"
13,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Mio, don't be mean to Misaki! I'm sure she's just trying to keep us safe. We're all friends here, right?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Mio, your enthusiasm is charming, but accusing others of guilt based on their temperament is hardly a deductive method.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Mio,,"Hehe, sorry! I'm just curious! But really, if we don't share everything, how will the Seer know who to trust?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Misaki,,The Seer doesn't need our trust to divine; they only need a target. We should focus on contradictions in speech.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,Indeed. The truth often emerges in the gaps between what is said and what is omitted.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Kenji,,"I don't like the ""gaps"" part, it sounds scary! Let's just be nice and the werewolf will feel bad and give up!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, while your optimism is refreshing, I suspect the werewolf possesses a rather different moral compass.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Mio,,You guys are so boring! Let's just agree to watch everyone's reactions tomorrow. I'm going to be the best detective ever!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Mio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Misaki,,Agreed. Let us observe.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Misaki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,I shall do the same.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
25,0,4,talk,Kenji,,Me too! I'll protect everyone!,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,A sensible conclusion. I shall spend the night reflecting on our initial interactions.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
