33,1,1,talk,Mio,,"Good morning! Did everyone sleep well? I've been thinking, Benjamin was way too calm yesterday. Isn't that a bit suspicious?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"@Mio, you are again targeting people based on personality. Benjamin's logic was consistent.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,pass,Jonathan,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"@Mio, stop it! Benjamin was just being polite. We can't just pick on people because they're calm!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"@Mio, your persistence in targeting my temperament is almost flattering. However, it lacks any empirical evidence of malice.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Mio,,"Maybe the ""evidence"" is that he's trying too hard to sound smart! Like, ""empirical evidence""? Who even says that?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Misaki,,It is a normal way of speaking for some. I find Mio's eagerness to accuse others more distracting than helpful.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,It is interesting how some seek to lead the conversation through emotion rather than fact.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"I think we should just trust each other! If we keep fighting, the werewolf wins! Let's just be a team!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Jonathan, I agree. Emotional volatility can be a smokescreen. @Mio, if you have a logical reason to suspect me, I would be delighted to hear it.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Mio,,I just have a feeling! Feelings are important too! Maybe the Seer already knows something and is waiting for us to notice?,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Misaki,,Feelings are not reliable in a game of deception. We need a concrete reason to vote.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I believe we should look at who is attempting to divert attention away from the group's stability.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Misaki, @Jonathan, you guys are making me nervous! Can't we just talk about something happy for a second?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, happiness is a luxury we cannot afford until the threat is neutralized. @Mio, ""feelings"" are the opposite of evidence.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Mio,,"Fine, fine! You guys are all so stiff! I'll just vote for who seems the most ""wolfy"" to me!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Misaki,,"If we must vote without a clear culprit, we should avoid random choices. But Mio's behavior is becoming a liability.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I have observed enough. I believe the most disruptive element is the one most likely to be hiding their true nature.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Kenji,,No! Don't vote for Mio! She's just being herself! I'll vote for whoever you guys want if it stops the fighting!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,It seems we have a choice between a disruptive personality and a lack of evidence. I will vote based on the most illogical behavior.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
